---
import Base from "../layouts/Base.astro";
import { email } from "../data.js";
---

<Base title="Privacy" description="What artifisi.com collects about you, which is almost nothing.">
  <h1>Privacy</h1>
  <p class="small">Last updated 24 October 2026.</p>
  <p>This site has no accounts and no analytics. We don't set cookies.</p>
  <p>
    The contact form sends your name, email and message through Formspree, which delivers it to our inbox. We
    use it only to reply.
  </p>
  <p>
    Our host, Cloudflare, keeps normal server logs: IP address, browser, which page. We only use them to keep
    the site running.
  </p>
  <p>
    Videos play from Google Drive and YouTube (privacy-enhanced mode). They only load when you press play, and
    Google may set its own cookies then.
  </p>
  <p>
    If you email us or use the form, we keep the message so we can reply, and we don't share it. Ask at
    <a href={`mailto:${email}`}>{email}</a> and we'll delete it.
  </p>
</Base>
